---
/**
 * Development showcase. Motion is a crawler + build log, not fade-in cards.
 * Proof is this site. No client domains. No invented results.
 */
---

<section class="studio" id="workbench" data-studio>
  <div class="page-container studio-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Working sample</p>
    <h2>This website is the <span>development brief</span>, not a mood board</h2>
    <p>
      This site is Astro with a Contentful blog, named authors, a generated sitemap and launch checks that the same team runs on client builds. If a section cannot survive a crawl, a form test and a metadata pass, it does not ship.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="hud-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hud-track">
      <span>CRAWL</span><span>RENDER</span><span>REDIRECT</span><span>SCHEMA</span><span>FORM</span><span>SITEMAP</span><span>GSC</span><span>CRAWL</span><span>RENDER</span><span>REDIRECT</span><span>SCHEMA</span><span>FORM</span><span>SITEMAP</span><span>GSC</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container crawl-wrap">
    <div class="hud-corners" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="crawl-head">
      <p class="crawl-kicker">How a build gets seen</p>
      <p class="hud-status">PATH.ESTABLISHED · INDEX.READY</p>
      <div class="radar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    </div>
    <svg class="crawl-map" viewBox="0 0 720 210" role="img" aria-label="Crawler moving through Home, Development, Blog, About and Contact">
      <path class="crawl-track" d="M80 110 C 180 40, 250 40, 360 110 S 540 180, 640 110" fill="none" />
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(80 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Home</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(220 62)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Development</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(360 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Blog</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(500 158)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">About</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(640 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Contact</text>
      </g>
      <circle class="crawler" r="6" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container studio-grid">
    <article class="workbench" aria-label="Live Bright Forge build log">
      <header class="workbench-bar">
        <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="workbench-title">astro build · brightforge.com.ph</span>
        <span class="live-pill">live</span>
      </header>
      <ol class="build-log">
        <li><code>ok</code> templates render HTML, not an empty shell</li>
        <li><code>ok</code> Contentful posts land as static routes</li>
        <li><code>ok</code> sitemap built from pages plus published entries</li>
        <li><code>ok</code> authors, About, editorial standards linked</li>
        <li><code>ok</code> titles, H1s, schema and forms sit in the template</li>
        <li><code>hold</code> no public prices, no invented rankings, no client websites named</li>
      </ol>
    </article>

    <article class="page-frame" aria-label="Service page assembling">
      <p class="frame-label">Page coming together</p>
      <div class="frame-meta">
        <span>Title</span>
        <b class="type-line">Web Design &amp; Development Philippines | Bright Forge</b>
      </div>
      <div class="frame-h1">SEO-First Web Development</div>
      <div class="frame-body">
        <p>First screen states the job. Not a slogan.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>H1 and title do different work</li>
          <li>Internal links to real URLs</li>
          <li>FAQ visible on the page</li>
          <li>Contact form on the same domain</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="frame-chips">
        <span>schema</span>
        <span>canonical</span>
        <span>sitemap</span>
        <span>GSC after launch</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container jobs-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we actually build</p>
    <h2>The work is <span>templates, launches and CMS control</span></h2>
    <div class="jobs">
      <article class="job job-wide">
        <h3>Service templates that can rank</h3>
        <p>One H1, a commercial first screen, FAQs that match schema, and internal links that point at pages that exist. We do not spin thin city pages for offices we do not have.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>Blog that rebuilds itself</h3>
        <p>Contentful or WordPress in, static routes out. New posts do not wait on a designer to put them live by hand.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>Migrations without silent 404s</h3>
        <p>URL map first. Redirects, canonicals and Search Console after launch. Pretty homepage last.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>WordPress without plugin soup</h3>
        <p>Template-level titles, headings and schema. Editors keep control. Theme bloat is not the strategy.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>App stacks when the product needs them</h3>
        <p>Next, React or SvelteKit only when the interface needs it. Marketing pages stay crawlable.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container launch-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Launch sheet</p>
      <h2>If it is not on this list, <span>it is not launched</span></h2>
      <p>Same pass we run on our own site. Boring on purpose.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="launch-sheet">
      <li><span>01</span> Rendered HTML, not an empty shell</li>
      <li><span>02</span> Title, H1, canonical, indexation</li>
      <li><span>03</span> Internal links hit 200s</li>
      <li><span>04</span> Forms submit on the live domain</li>
      <li><span>05</span> Sitemap includes the new URLs</li>
      <li><span>06</span> Redirects from the old map</li>
      <li><span>07</span> Search Console after deploy</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const studio = document.querySelector('[data-studio]');
  if (studio && !window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) studio.classList.add('is-live');
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.2 }
    );
    io.observe(studio);
  } else if (studio) {
    studio.classList.add('is-live');
  }
</script>

<style>
  .studio {
    padding: 0 0 40px;
    background: #0d0f1a;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .studio .page-container {
    width: min(100% - 40px, 1120px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .studio-intro { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .hud-marquee {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.25);
    background: #0a0c16;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    width: min(100% - 40px, 1120px);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
  .hud-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.4rem;
    width: max-content;
    animation: ticker 22s linear infinite;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .28em;
    color: rgba(240,98,42,.85);
  }
  .hud-track span { white-space: nowrap; }
  .crawl-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(240,98,42,.08), transparent 42%),
      #12162a;
    padding: 18px 18px 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hud-corners {
    pointer-events: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8px;
    border: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top left / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top left / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top right / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top right / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom left / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom left / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom right / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom right / 2px 18px no-repeat;
  }
  .crawl-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .hud-status {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    font-size: .68rem;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }
  .radar {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.45);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240,98,42,.2) 2px, transparent 3px),
      repeating-radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 7px, rgba(240,98,42,.2) 7px 8px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .radar i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0 280deg, rgba(240,98,42,.55) 320deg, transparent 360deg);
    animation: sweep 3.2s linear infinite;
  }
  .crawl-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #f0622a;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .crawl-map { width: 100%; max-height: 200px; height: auto; display: block; }
  .crawl-track {
    stroke: rgba(240,98,42,.45);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 8 10;
    animation: dash 18s linear infinite;
  }
  .crawl-node circle { fill: #1c2136; stroke: #f0622a; stroke-width: 2; }
  .crawl-node text {
    fill: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-anchor: middle;
    font-family: Outfit, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .crawler {
    fill: #f0622a;
    offset-path: path('M80 110 C 180 40, 250 40, 360 110 S 540 180, 640 110');
    offset-distance: 0%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #f0622a);
  }
  .studio.is-live .crawler { animation: crawl 7.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .studio-grid,
  .launch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(280px, .85fr);
    gap: clamp(22px, 4vw, 40px);
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .workbench,
  .page-frame,
  .job,
  .launch-sheet {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: #14182a;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  }
  .workbench { border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .page-frame { border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; }
  .workbench-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: #1c2136;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    font-size: .78rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  }
  .live-pill {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #7dffb3;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: .64rem;
  }
  .studio.is-live .live-pill { animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .dots {
    width: 38px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 5px 5px, #f0622a 4px, transparent 5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 19px 5px, #c9a227 4px, transparent 5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 33px 5px, #3d8bfd 4px, transparent 5px);
  }
  .build-log {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 0 12px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: .86rem;
  }
  .build-log li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    opacity: .22;
    transform: translateX(-8px);
  }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li {
    animation: log-in .5s ease forwards;
  }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .15s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .45s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .75s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.05s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.35s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 1.65s; }
  .build-log code {
    min-width: 2.6rem;
    color: #7dffb3;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .build-log li:last-child code { color: #f0622a; }
  .frame-label {
    color: #f0622a;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .frame-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  }
  .frame-meta span {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    font-size: .72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }
  .frame-meta b, .frame-h1 { color: #fff; }
  .frame-h1 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);
  }
  .studio.is-live .frame-h1 { animation: reveal 1.1s .4s ease forwards; }
  .frame-body p, .frame-body li {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .frame-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .frame-chips span {
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.35);
    color: #f3c2a8;
    font-size: .72rem;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transform: rotate(-6deg) scale(.86);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .studio.is-live .frame-chips span {
    animation: stamp .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.3,1) forwards;
  }
  .studio.is-live .frame-chips span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 1.1s; }
  .studio.is-live .frame-chips span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.3s; }
  .studio.is-live .frame-chips span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  .studio.is-live .frame-chips span:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.7s; }
  .jobs-block { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .jobs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .job { padding: 22px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .job-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .job h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.12rem; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .job p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); line-height: 1.65; }
  .launch-sheet {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .launch-sheet li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }
  .launch-sheet span {
    color: #f0622a;
    font-weight: 800;
    min-width: 1.6rem;
  }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li {
    animation: tick .4s ease forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .2s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .35s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .5s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .65s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: .8s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: .95s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 1.1s; }
  @keyframes crawl {
    0% { offset-distance: 0%; }
    100% { offset-distance: 100%; }
  }
  @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -180; } }
  @keyframes log-in { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes reveal { to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } }
  @keyframes stamp { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes tick { to { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes pulse {
    50% { opacity: .35; }
  }
  @keyframes ticker { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  @keyframes sweep { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .studio-grid, .launch-grid, .jobs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .job-wide { grid-column: auto; }
    .crawl-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
    .hud-status { display: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .crawler, .crawl-track, .build-log li, .frame-h1, .frame-chips span, .launch-sheet li, .live-pill, .hud-track, .radar i {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 1 !important;
      transform: none !important;
      clip-path: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
